{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》由一眾主持帶領觀眾走訪三間極具特色的優質餐廳！從九龍城主打零味精的精緻私房菜，到錦田氣氛悠閒的隱世村屋餐廳，再到中環的道地泰國菜館，每一間都充滿驚喜，絕對是搵食好去處。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由昌師傅帶領波波（黃婧靈）造訪一間主打零味精的高質私房菜館，品嚐多款矜貴海鮮與惹味小菜。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食得妙私房粵菜 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：九龍城福佬村道64號地下</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7d7fc7a6-b701-4b68-97aa-4de3994a8c4d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pNDaLPZIq01788938125.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7d7fc7a6-b701-4b68-97aa-4de3994a8c4d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b213a4fd-6179-4b4a-8ee9-e64a2720dc27.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XExo6n3ysq1788938125.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b213a4fd-6179-4b4a-8ee9-e64a2720dc27.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"79172f9a-5766-44f2-8be6-3afad76d1da3.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202652WD84Q6Tr1788938125.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"79172f9a-5766-44f2-8be6-3afad76d1da3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f37950f-3c47-462d-93a9-6257d224a630.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026o18EKaENDh1788938124.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f37950f-3c47-462d-93a9-6257d224a630.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由黃嘉雯帶領伍倩彤（Gillian）來到錦田一間氣氛悠閒的隱世村屋餐廳。店家堅持每天採用極新鮮食材，由於數量有限，大部分食材必須提前預約預留。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Crazy February </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：元朗錦田高埔村映堤105號地舖 (爾巒側)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1acdf228-79cb-4962-8d5c-95178d528d20.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Z1muhAhEXB1788938127.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1acdf228-79cb-4962-8d5c-95178d528d20.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"677251aa-eb64-472b-b09f-3aec1a5af6df.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263Wq2Maivj71788938126.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"677251aa-eb64-472b-b09f-3aec1a5af6df.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"265355ee-fef7-44bd-8356-e5f498b0bd4e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026b6MbT6ZB391788938124.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"265355ee-fef7-44bd-8356-e5f498b0bd4e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後一站，黃嘉雯帶同葉靖儀造訪中環一間風味地道的泰國餐廳，品嚐層次豐富的特色泰菜。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Here Thai By Chef Lenk </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：中環威靈頓街50號華威大廈地下A號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f4fed8b3-d041-427d-916d-918af83c8661.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xOPGOerO5L1788938127.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f4fed8b3-d041-427d-916d-918af83c8661.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a8d83666-4077-45e2-aac9-bcd86cc1b246.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026j1B5BrtcE81788938126.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a8d83666-4077-45e2-aac9-bcd86cc1b246.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d5e35ae7-b980-4a0f-bfc7-1a3b139eb1de.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026T0NhOI15pu1788938126.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d5e35ae7-b980-4a0f-bfc7-1a3b139eb1de.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T13:19:30.898586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}